# Sudoku: puzzle data is committed once, as the built output under games/sudoku/data.
# The source-side copy is byte-identical, so tracking both would double the repo cost
# (~2MB of JSON per copy). To restore it after a fresh clone:
#   cp -r games/sudoku/data/* games/sudoku-src/public/data/
# Without it, `npm run build` produces an app with no puzzles.
games/sudoku-src/public/data/

